      "json": [
        {
          "text": "This legendary crown was originally forged by an archmage of old. \n\nImbued with tremendous power, it serves to make a mage able to "
        },
        {
          "text": "cast spells more efficiently",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". It also draws in ambient magic, allowing a "
        },
        {
          "text": "larger reservoir of mana",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ". Finally, it is rumored that this crown can also occasionally "
        },
        {
          "text": "protect its wearer from debilitating effects",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", but only every so often.\n\nThis crown can only be crafted by those who have allied themselves to the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Council of Wizards",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
